Z||000001||BAM-BAM||06-24-2001||10:46 PM||||  Give us the low down. What options does it have, how many miles, wheels and tires, that sort of stuff. One thing to note; if it's a low milage Fiero and there is not a thing wrong with it, just leave it like it is. However, you might want to lower it using Eibach ProKit lowering springs (really easy). GM left to much room in those wheel wells. Other than that, we'll have to see what you got first. Got any pic's ???? Use the PIP image poster located at the bottom of the page to get them up for all to see.<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
